From 628ae0c85230ce30a9882aca0a9e47a3412ba3c7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: road-trip-loop <loop@road-trip-game.local>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 06:14:40 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] The truck's open bed and cargo places
 (core/onfoot/cargo.ts)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- the truck stands in the way as boxes: a deck one can stand on, low walls, tailgate, headboard,
  cab; 爬上去 at the tailgate puts one on the bed (jump down over the tailgate)
- CargoBay per vehicle: Inventory(n, BIG_ONLY) with a body-frame place per slot and the litres of
  a vessel; 放上车 / 拿 / 抬; truck bed 4, van rear deck 2, motorhome rear carrier 2 (drawn as a
  small steel rack), the off-roader none; things ride in one inked mesh on the vehicle's root
- the places by the road are solids for walkers (world.sites added to player.solids)
- hooks footGive / footCargo / footClimb; shots bed_cargo, on_bed; harness/sim/cargo.test.ts

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

